WEBVTT

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.360
All right, game's over.

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.780
<i>I meant to go all out here,</i>

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:25.490
<i>but it's a lot harder than I thought.</i>

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.740
<i>Like fighting down to your last pellet.</i>

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.250
Yura?

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.540
Oh, there you are, Yura.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.780
Here I am.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.110
You're late.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:02.480
Sorry.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.320
Looks like you've come prepared.

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.430
Yura and I are gonna go one-on-one.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:16.470
We'll have fun...

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.270
And win.

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.990
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:35.990
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.490
I decided this myself

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.490
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:48.000
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.960
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:58.880
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:03.800
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:08.100
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.440
I will hold my head high

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:15.110
I'll change my life,

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:18.150
and the gray rules that govern it

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.990
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:29.910
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:36.630
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:59.030
Have fun and win!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:16.800
<i>There she is.</i>

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.310
What?!

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:26.780
She dodged it!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.500
I'm back, Sono.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.250
Welcome back, Yura.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.460
God, I'm beat.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:50.900
Honestly.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.110
Here, have some tea and snacks.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.410
Not really in the mood.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:58.710
You know you're gonna be sore tomorrow.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.270
Is he not doing well?

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.490
It's been one thing after another with this guy.

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.610
He gets touchy over everything.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.520
Sure you're not just mistreating him?

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.000
Kari...

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.210
You must have...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.510
cheated on him.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.420
I-I didn't!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.550
I was just browsing on the internet!

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.420
You cheated on him.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.520
Yeah, you did.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.400
He thought you were faithful.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.230
He didn't think you'd start eyeing others.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.860
Cut it out!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.110
Seriously...

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.100
Hey!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.890
Where are you?

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:46.990
Come out!

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.770
It's my fault!

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:51.870
I'm sorry, so please come back!

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.750
Please!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.980
I wonder how the others are doing.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:03.150
Sono looked like she could keep fighting all day.

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:06.630
And Yura got hyped the moment she got here!

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:13.930
You know, I really feel like they're in a different world from us now.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.230
Rento to main squad.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:25.070
Hey, main squad here.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:27.070
What're you doing?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.440
I'm on the third floor.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.660
Come here please.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:32.910
Let's watch them.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.470
Ren?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.990
Right now, Sono and Yura are having their final...

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.800
and dare I say finest airsoft battle ever.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.740
So let's watch them.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.520
They're sure at it.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.750
Who's on top right now?

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.780
Sono... I guess.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.290
Sono's on the move.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.130
She's trying to flank Yura.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.230
She's so fast.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:14.390
So efficient.

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:18.830
Yura noticed it!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.600
Good job.

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.620
Man, they're neck and neck.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:27.240
Yura's changed so much.

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:31.670
She can hold her own against Sono's best!

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.030
Yura's attacking right now.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:39.480
Hey!

00:07:45.260 --> 00:07:46.760
That was close!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.320
Kari, whose side are you on?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:54.200
Yeah! Yura's taking revenge for us!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.040
They look like they're having fun.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.470
Yura, go right!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:12.570
No, left!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.590
Now! Attack!

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.170
Yura?

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.260
She looks like she's in trouble.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.870
Yeah.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.940
She did a great job, hands down.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.080
Huh?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.270
Yura?

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:45.110
She's not firing.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.930
Don't tell me...

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.360
Is she out of pellets?

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.060
She's calling for me.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.640
Hey, what's up, Rento?

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:24.990
Rento to everyone.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:33.310
Kirishima Rento will now support our allied troops.

00:10:08.630 --> 00:10:10.130
I'm here for you.

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:49.050
Ren.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:56.060
Thanks for introducing me to airsoft.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:00.260
My pleasure.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.640
The tables have turned.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:24.830
I've never seen her so panicked.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:27.810
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.960
No, don't go there!

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:37.240
Aw, screw it!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:45.830
So fast!

00:11:55.670 --> 00:11:58.470
Say hello to the cavalry!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.410
You can thank me later.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.490
Maybe if you don't slow me down.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:06.710
Oh, please.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.920
Hey, let's go too!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.850
Onwards, troops.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.190
Yura!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.280
Get ready, bitches!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.060
What the—

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.500
Stay frosty, Sono.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.300
2-on-2-on-2!

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.680
Gotcha.

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.010
Then let's go!

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:26.660
That's the last game.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:27.780
It's ove—

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:28.830
No it's not!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.750
Yura?

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:36.570
Sono, you've always tried to enjoy airsoft.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:38.870
I...

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:46.110
We all followed your example, and that's why we're all here.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.370
We still have pellets left.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.090
Let's continue!

00:14:58.490 --> 00:15:00.250
Let's have all the fun we can!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:03.890
Let's laugh until we pass out!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:08.090
There's no such thing as a final game in the C3 club!

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.680
What's going on?

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:42.070
To all students.

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:48.660
This is a notice from the student council of Stella Girls' Academy.

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:57.680
So that everyone can enjoy their time here, there are certain rules all must adhere to.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:09.570
Don't take your goggles off on the skirm site.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:16.730
When you return to the safety zone, take out your magazine and engage the safety on your gun.

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:17.910
What on...

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:29.880
Properly announce getting hit and leave the skirm site.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.940
Please enjoy your time.

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:50.010
Is this your doing, Yura?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.740
Yep.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:59.660
How many students did our school have again?

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:03.910
Somewhere around... 1800, I think?

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:08.080
It's a Stella Girls' Academy High School Regiment.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:12.090
I think there might be a bit of a handicap.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.530
All right, let's start.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:20.920
Or rather, let's continue.

00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:23.430
Hearken, students!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.770
Everyone is a combatant!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:27.190
Game starts in 6 seconds!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:28.190
5...

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.190
4...

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.190
3...

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:31.190
2...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.440
1...

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.490
Go!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.750
So what now?

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:15.160
Fight monsters at the South Pole?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:18.140
A last stand in a star fort?

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.720
We can have anything!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:23.870
We're flat out of pellets and batteries.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.960
All right.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:29.190
I'll let you all off the hook here.

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:29.960
Count yourselves lucky.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.650
Huh?

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.300
You're gonna come back begging for another match.

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.420
I can't believe I worried about you.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:40.590
Well, hmm...

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.270
You guys should come with me!

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:51.940
Hell yeah!

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:53.440
Good idea!

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.650
Cool! Let's do it!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:59.990
Wait, do you think high schoolers can go abroad without supervision?

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:04.110
The chorus club went abroad, so we should be fine.

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:05.320
What's wrong?

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:06.950
Not interested, Yura?

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:08.920
I...

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.330
I'll wait for you.

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:18.590
Okay!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.810
All right, let's go together!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.810
Let's have fun...

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.330
And win!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:39.710
<i>It was a new world.</i>

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:44.330
<i>I thought it was distant and had no relation to me.</i>

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.550
<i>Just then, I stepped into that world.</i>

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.840
All right, that's it for today.

00:19:57.350 --> 00:20:00.020
There will be a quiz the day after tomorrow.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:03.050
I gave you some hints today.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.450
Make sure you study.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.600
Okay.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.530
What are you two doing?

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:27.310
Hono, you've been sounding blue lately.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:29.680
We're short a member.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.450
It was nothing short of a miracle we managed to find Yura this year,

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.680
but we'll have to keep the club alive next year.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:41.640
Getting stressed about it now won't get you anywhere.

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.730
So how about we cheer ourselves up with a match?

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.590
I'm in!

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.190
How about a Rambo-style game?

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:50.360
We did that yesterday.

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:54.870
We could do it every single day if you ask me.

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.560
Yura's late.

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:31.950
High school's a way bigger drag than I thought it'd be, you know?

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:39.070
I was thinking my life would be all, like, totally different.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.320
What were you expecting?

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.110
That, like, never happens.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.580
Tried joinin' a club?

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.030
Huh? It's kinda late for it.

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.460
S-Sorry.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:54.790
What about the C3 club?

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:57.500
The C3 club?

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.380
Yeah.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.660
Want to try airsoft?

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.060
Command!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.930
Control!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.190
Communication!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.230
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:16.850
Yay!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.070
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.400
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.530
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.620
Yay!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.750
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.580
but that's fine

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:41.710
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Ready?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.220
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.260
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.970
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:55.980
All right?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.600
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.940
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.780
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:11.870
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.580
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.120
Okay!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.710
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.800
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.850
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.890
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.770
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.770 --> 00:24:09.590
Preview

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.270
I want to be the queen of the battlefield!

00:23:43.270 --> 00:23:45.480
I'll be the cosplay queen, then!

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.820
I'll be a mangosteen!

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:49.960
I'll be the queen of arguments!

00:23:49.960 --> 00:23:52.120
Honoka, you can be the queen of tits!

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:53.610
The queen of tits!

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:55.580
Why did you say that twice?

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:09.590
Be the queens of war, soldiers!

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:56.430
Next episode.

00:23:56.430 --> 00:23:58.570
Be the queens of war, soldiers!

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:00.390
Which queen will you be, Sono?

00:24:00.390 --> 00:24:01.580
Me?

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:03.250
I'll be...

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:05.450
The queen of queens!
